            }

            .text-big {
                font-size: 27px;
            }

            .text-small {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .thumbnail {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Thanh điều hướng -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">WEB DEV</div>

        <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="#web">Web Technology</a></li>
            <li><a href="#program">C Programming</a></li>
            <li><a href="#course">Courses</a></li>
        </ul>

        <form class="rightNav" id="searchForm">
            <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Tìm kiếm...">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Search</button>
        </form>
    </nav>

    <!-- Phần 1: Web Technology -->
    <section class="firstsection">
        <div class="box-main">
            <div class="firstHalf">
                <h1 class="text-big" id="web">Web Technology</h1>

                <p class="text-small">
                    HTML stands for HyperText Markup Language. It is used to
                    create the structure of web pages. HTML defines headings,
                    paragraphs, images, links and other elements displayed
                    by a web browser. Combined with CSS and JavaScript,
                    HTML helps developers build modern and interactive websites.
                </p>

                <p class="text-small">
                    CSS is used to style web pages, including colors, fonts,
                    spacing and layout. Understanding HTML and CSS is an
                    important first step in web development.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Phần 2: C Programming -->
    <section class="secondsection">
        <div class="box-main">
            <div class="secondHalf">
                <h1 class="text-big" id="program">C Programming</h1>

                <p class="text-small">
                    C is a procedural programming language developed by
                    Dennis Ritchie. It is widely used in system programming,
                    operating systems and embedded applications.
                </p>

                <p class="text-small">
                    C provides useful features such as variables, loops,
                    functions, arrays and pointers. Learning C helps students
                    understand fundamental programming concepts and
                    problem-solving techniques.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Phần 3: Java -->
    <section class="section section-Left" id="course">
        <div class="paras">
            <h1 class="text-big">Java Programming</h1>

            <p class="text-small">
                Java is a popular object-oriented programming language.
                Java source code is compiled into bytecode, which runs
                on the Java Virtual Machine (JVM). This allows Java
                applications to run on different operating systems
                that support the JVM.
            </p>

            <p class="text-small">
                Java is commonly used to develop web applications,
                desktop software, enterprise systems and Android apps.
                It is a useful language for students who want to learn
                object-oriented programming.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="thumbnail">
            <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?w=700"
                alt="Laptop used for programming">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Chân trang -->
    <footer>
        <p>Copyright &copy; 2026 - All rights reserved</p>
        <p>Simple Web Development Template</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // Xử lý tìm kiếm đơn giản
        document.getElementById("searchForm").addEventListener("submit", function(event) {
            event.preventDefault();

            var keyword = document.getElementById("search").value.toLowerCase().trim();

            if (keyword === "") {
                alert("Vui lòng nhập từ khóa cần tìm!");
                return;
            }

            if (keyword.includes("web") || keyword.includes("html")) {
                document.getElementById("web").scrollIntoView();
            } else if (keyword.includes("c programming") || keyword === "c") {
                document.getElementById("program").scrollIntoView();
            } else if (keyword.includes("java") || keyword.includes("course")) {
                document.getElementById("course").scrollIntoView();
            } else {
                alert("Không tìm thấy nội dung phù hợp!");
            }
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
